{% doc %}
  Summary under the product title ("summary" block in sections/cv-product-counter.liquid):
  stars · rating · (count reviews), then price · compare-at · Save, then a one-line pitch.

  Every number is live: the rating comes only from this product's Judge.me reviews by
  verified buyers (snippets/cv-jm-verified.liquid). Imported, typed-in and unverified
  reviews never count, and no store rating stands in for the product's own. Reviews of
  cases the shop sent as gifts stay out of a buyer's rating; while no buyer has reviewed
  the product, their rating shows and the count says "gifted cases". With none at all,
  the "no reviews" label links to the reviews section. The prices come from the selected
  variant — cv-product.js keeps them in step when the shopper changes variant. The Google
  and Trustpilot tickets (snippets/cv-store-ratings.liquid) sit directly under the price.

  @param {object} block - The summary block.
  @param {object} product - The product being shown.
  @param {object} variant - The selected variant.
  @param {object} settings - The section's settings (store rating, reviews anchor).
{% enddoc %}
{%- capture jm_stats -%}{%- render 'cv-jm-verified', mode: 'stats', scope: 'product', handle: product.handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- liquid
  assign rating_value = 0
  assign rating_count = ''
  assign rating_is_store = false
  assign rating_is_gift = false

  comment
    Stats (cv-jm-verified): buyers' count and sum, then gifted cases' count and sum.
  endcomment
  assign jm_parts = jm_stats | split: '␟'
  assign jm_n = jm_parts[0] | plus: 0
  assign jm_gift_n = jm_parts[2] | plus: 0
  if jm_n > 0
    assign rating_value = jm_parts[1] | plus: 0 | times: 1.0 | divided_by: jm_n
    assign rating_count = jm_n
  elsif jm_gift_n > 0
    assign rating_value = jm_parts[3] | plus: 0 | times: 1.0 | divided_by: jm_gift_n
    assign rating_count = jm_gift_n
    assign rating_is_gift = true
  endif
  assign can_write = false
  if block.settings.empty_label != blank
    assign can_write = true
  endif
  assign rating_shown = rating_value | round: 1
  assign star_fill = rating_value | times: 20

  comment
    Only the variant's real compare-at price: the struck-through price and the
    saving must be a price the product actually sold at, never a fallback.
  endcomment
  assign was_price = variant.compare_at_price | default: 0
  assign has_was = false
  if was_price > variant.price
    assign has_was = true
    assign saving = was_price | minus: variant.price
    assign saving_pct = saving | times: 100.0 | divided_by: was_price | round
  endif

  comment
    With no products picked, the pitch is the template-wide case line, so it shows on cases only
    (snippets/cv-is-case.liquid). A product picked by name always gets it.
  endcomment
  assign pitch = ''
  assign pitch_here = true
  if block.settings.pitch_products.size > 0
    assign pitch_here = false
    for p in block.settings.pitch_products
      if p.id == product.id
        assign pitch_here = true
        break
      endif
    endfor
  else
    capture pitch_case
      render 'cv-is-case', product: product
    endcapture
    unless pitch_case contains 'true'
      assign pitch_here = false
    endunless
  endif
  if pitch_here
    assign pitch = block.settings.tagline
  endif
  assign key_parts = block.settings.tagline_metafield | strip | split: '.'
  if key_parts.size == 2
    assign pitch_ns = key_parts[0]
    assign pitch_key = key_parts[1]
    assign pitch_field = product.metafields[pitch_ns][pitch_key].value
    if pitch_field != blank
      assign pitch = pitch_field
    endif
  endif
  assign anchor = settings.reviews_anchor | default: 'cvc-reviews' | remove: '#'
-%}
<div class="cvc-sum" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if rating_value > 0 -%}
    <a class="cvc-sum__rating" href="#{{ anchor | escape }}">
      <span class="cvc-sum__stars" aria-hidden="true">{%- render 'cv-stars', fill: star_fill -%}</span>
      {%- if rating_is_store -%}<span class="cvc-sum__source" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'products.rating.store_rating_label' | t }}</span>{%- endif -%}
      <strong class="cvc-sum__score" aria-hidden="true">{{ rating_shown }}</strong>
      {%- comment -%} The store rating is the combined Google and Trustpilot figure (DECISIONS.md 2026-10-26), and says so. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if rating_is_store and rating_count != blank -%}
        <span class="cvc-sum__count" aria-hidden="true">({{ 'products.rating.store_reviews_combined' | t: count: rating_count }})</span>
      {%- elsif rating_is_store -%}
        <span class="cvc-sum__count" aria-hidden="true">({{ 'products.review_badges.combined' | t }})</span>
      {%- elsif rating_count != blank -%}
        <span class="cvc-sum__count" aria-hidden="true">({{ rating_count }} {% if rating_count == 1 %}review{% else %}{{ 'products.product_summary.reviews' | t }}{% endif %}{% if rating_is_gift %}, gifted {% if rating_count == 1 %}case{% else %}cases{% endif %}{% endif %})</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="cvc__visually-hidden">
        {%- if rating_is_store and rating_count != blank -%}
          {{ 'products.review_badges.combined_label' | t: rating: rating_shown, count: rating_count }}
        {%- elsif rating_is_store -%}
          {{ 'products.review_badges.combined_label_no_count' | t: rating: rating_shown }}
        {%- elsif rating_is_gift -%}
          Rated {{ rating_shown }} out of 5 from {{ rating_count }} {% if rating_count == 1 %}review of a gifted case{% else %}reviews of gifted cases{% endif %}
        {%- else -%}
          {{ 'products.product_summary.rating_label' | t: rating: rating_shown, count: rating_count }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
    </a>
  {%- elsif can_write -%}
    <a class="cvc-sum__rating" href="#{{ anchor | escape }}">
      <span class="cvc-sum__stars" aria-hidden="true">{%- render 'cv-stars', fill: 0 -%}</span>
      <span class="cvc-sum__count">{{ block.settings.empty_label | escape }}</span>
    </a>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if block.settings.show_price -%}
    <p class="cvc-sum__price">
      <span class="cvc-sum__now"><span class="cvc__visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price_offer.now' | t }}: </span><span data-cv-sum-now>{{ variant.price | money }}</span></span>
      <s class="cvc-sum__was" data-cv-sum-was-wrap{% unless has_was %} hidden{% endunless %}><span class="cvc__visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price_offer.compare_at' | t }}: </span><span data-cv-sum-was>{%- if has_was -%}{{ was_price | money }}{%- endif -%}</span></s>
      <span class="cvc-sum__save" data-cv-sum-save{% if block.settings.save_style == 'percent' %} data-percent{% endif %}{% unless has_was %} hidden{% endunless %}>
        {{- 'products.product_summary.save' | t }} <span data-cv-sum-save-value>
          {%- if has_was -%}{%- if block.settings.save_style == 'percent' -%}{{ saving_pct }}%{%- else -%}{{ saving | money }}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
        </span>
      </span>
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- render 'cv-store-ratings', settings: settings -%}

  {%- if pitch != blank -%}
    <p class="cvc-sum__pitch">{{ pitch | escape }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
